WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.233 --> 00:00:04.633
Abra o separador Quadro contabilístico.

2
00:00:04.633 --> 00:00:10.066
Valor de aquisição 1.200,00 € e vida útil 3.

3
00:00:10.066 --> 00:00:17.033
No Quadro fiscal, escolha a taxa do DR 25/2009.

4
00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:19.366
